      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know. i just feel like there is something fundamentally wrong with me. like i've always been this way, just watching things happen and not being able to do anything. it's like i'm just a bystander in my own life and i've let people down so many times it's actually pathetic. i don't think i'm a good person.",
